## Changes Made

### HTMLPreview Component
- ✅ Renders HTML content in sandboxed iframe for security
- ✅ Includes toolbar with Refresh and Fullscreen buttons
- ✅ Auto-renders when HTML prop updates
- ✅ Proper error handling
- ✅ Dark theme styling matching the app

### Code Component Updates
- ✅ Added `HTMLPreview` import
- ✅ Detects `html` language blocks
- ✅ Added `showHTMLPreview` computed property
- ✅ Added toggle button to switch between code and preview views
- ✅ Updated `showCode` logic to hide code when HTML preview is active
- ✅ Maintains existing functionality for markdown and mermaid blocks

I'll fix the language detection to only show HTML preview for actual HTML blocks, not Vue files.

